# Docs

`docs/STATUS.md` is the snapshot; `docs/DECISIONS.md` is append-only ADRs. If a phase gate is hit or a backend is chosen, update both in the same change.

Do not put calendar-week promises in docs. Phases are proof order.

Title facts belong in `docs/GAMES.md` plus `profiles/`. Do not invent a second compatibility database.

When you mention GPTK, say eval-only unless ADR-002 has been accepted as a ship strategy (it has not).
